{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他发现对方依然愿意亲近自己，于是想更主动、大方地回应，也开始期待两个人能一直这样好下去。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"心动、期待、轻快、带点试探，同时有些不安。\",\n      \"missed\": \"小字里的身体恢复弹性、玩心和调情般的回应不容易一眼抓到；右侧四个阶段标签也需要专门看。第三段关于眼下亲近但未来未必如此的具体担忧，需要读完整句才能理解。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他因为对方仍然亲近而重新有了期待，想主动回应，甚至开始盼望两个人能长久地保持这种关系。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"期待、心动、轻松、甜蜜中带着不确定。\",\n      \"missed\": \"主要信息依然能抓到，但身体恢复弹性、玩心和调情般回应这些感受描述容易略过；右侧阶段标签与人物当前状态的对应关系也不容易一眼建立。底部动画只能感受到音乐流动，不能直接看出人物的具体处境。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他因为两个人目前依然亲近而开始期待未来，但又担心这种亲近不能一直持续，所以心里仍然没底。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"心动、期待、快乐余韵、怀念，以及隐约的不安。\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的歌声向上散开、忽然停止以及快乐余温转为怀念这一层，需要逐句读才能理解；它与人物关系变化之间的联系也不是一眼就能抓到。右侧阶段标签仍然容易被忽略。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"同屏有三段字号都很醒目的长句，分别讲想主动回应、开始期待长久、又担心亲近不能持续，虽然内容实际连贯，但第一眼需要在几个重要信息之间切换，核心状态不够集中。第三张新增的音乐感受描述又增加了一层注意力竞争，而且歌声、底部动画与人物关系之间的联系需要读完才能建立。整体能看出他正在从心动和不安走向期待，但画面、音乐感受与人物处境还没有完全形成一眼就能识别的整体。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c5405c62-576f-4bfa-8e49-5d6ff02f844b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T223622608122Z", "elapsed_seconds": 73.063, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T22:37:35.673696+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3f698686168470703fedffa582cbb00407958944d8ed7fdc60f274f72d8340f6", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T223622608122Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "19d47dfc6ff803de5c548c9633b9df0ba6819e6539262b3539a2b06edd7dfdd5"}}}
